%description:
A frame still on the air when the simulation ends is deleted with the network, not
left behind: a radio holds a received frame until its transmission ends, and the
frames in flight at the time limit are disposed of at teardown. OMNeT++ reports an
object a module still owns when it is deleted as "undisposed object" (print-undisposed).

The network is one gNB and one NR UE with downlink and uplink traffic in every slot;
the time limit falls inside a slot (0.2003 s at numerology 0), so data frames, H-ARQ
feedback and CQI reports sent at 0.200 s are still being received when the run ends.

Checks: the run ends at the time limit, and no undisposed object is reported.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork
print-undisposed = true
sim-time-limit = 0.2003s

*.server.numApps = 2
*.server.app[0].typename = "UdpBasicApp"
*.server.app[0].destAddresses = "ue[0]"
*.server.app[0].destPort = 1000
*.server.app[0].messageLength = 1000B
*.server.app[0].sendInterval = 1ms
*.server.app[0].startTime = 0.05s

*.ue[0].numApps = 2
*.ue[0].app[0].typename = "UdpSink"
*.ue[0].app[0].localPort = 1000
*.ue[0].app[1].typename = "UdpBasicApp"
*.ue[0].app[1].destAddresses = "server"
*.ue[0].app[1].destPort = 1000
*.ue[0].app[1].messageLength = 500B
*.ue[0].app[1].sendInterval = 1ms
*.ue[0].app[1].startTime = 0.05s
*.server.app[1].typename = "UdpSink"
*.server.app[1].localPort = 1000

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Simulation time limit reached
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
undisposed object
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
